    "conversion_check": {
      "description": "For labels, target_pose composed with the anchor-relative position and measured TCP composed with the body correction both reconstruct the demonstrated command from native-command FK. Their causal blend therefore reconstructs the same world position, and body rotation reconstructs command orientation before verified Panda IK. World TCP position, rotation angle and gripper scalar are compared; nonunique IK is allowed.",
